<div class="hero-section">
    <h1 class="hero-title">Hey there! 👋 I'm Rob, and I'm diving deep into the world of AI and tech.</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">From Jersey City to the cutting edge of artificial intelligence, I'm on a mission to bridge communities and technology through learning, building, and sharing.</p>
